{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act28side_level_act28side_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act28side",
  "stageId": "act28side_04",
  "title": "缺席的人",
  "storyCode": "CV-4",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act28side/level_act28side_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e8be4d5008932578601d67079d04a30ff3b1be66da889bf8f7a0910fbd476e06",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說來也奇怪，供暖還能勉強維持，爐子也點著，為什麼還是感覺這麼冷？銀行不會又在搞鬼吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "反正我的襪子一晚上都沒乾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，什麼聲音……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "伍迪，說過多少次了，刮刮鬍子吧！每次你喝完水都濺得桌子上滿是水點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "胡說，我從進門就沒喝水。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那這些水漬是怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這餐廳有點年份了，我的腦子也有些年頭了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以到底是我的記憶出了差錯，還是那片巨大的水痕真的一直在那裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "水管——水管炸了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天……我這破地板哪裡經得起泡一遍水啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快去關閥門，然後找個容器盛漫進來的水，樓上的東西我來收拾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的老腰啊，差點直不起來……樓上的情況怎麼樣，伍迪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我建議你找把椅子坐著聽，畢竟你也一把年紀了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "算了，還有什麼我沒見過，你直接說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "二樓的水已經齊膝深了，裡面的家具都泡壞了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……那我櫃子裡的衣服呢？都還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果我沒記錯，你是喜歡紅色的，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還行吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，那就好，管子裡面爆出來的水是鐵鏽色的，我估計你之後所有衣服都是那個顏色了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……伍迪，所以你去了一趟樓上到底做了什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "都在這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊……我差點把這箱子忘了，你從哪裡翻出來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還能在哪裡？當然是衣櫃，你就那幾個藏東西的地方，也不難找。還有你床頭櫃上的幾樣東西，我一併塞進來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔，還好，沒有進水，看看這裡面都有什麼……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……保單在裡面，今天的損失應該能用保險賠付，還有地契、房契……存摺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你還留著那存摺？明知道裡面的錢根本領不出來？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "換了你，你會隨手扔掉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你看，你不是也懂嗎？他那麼多年存下的已經不僅僅是錢了，那是心意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖，念舊的傢伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們都是老傢伙了，伍迪，比起不可捉摸的未來，還是那些常年累積下的點滴過往更加親切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不敢苟同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……看哪，還有這本小說，放在床頭，好久都沒翻開過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "富家千金和牧場小子，千篇一律的俗套戀愛故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "伍迪……那麼刻薄幹什麼？你就沒什麼好聽的話嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有啊，祝你明天去銀行一切順利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……你該慶幸，伍迪，我現在的脾氣比年輕時好太多。你呢，你明天要去做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我打算帶著潔西卡去找人聊聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "聊聊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對，簡單聊聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗魯的混混",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老……老爺子，放下銃吧，有話……有話我們可以好好說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看你嚇的，我覺得我還挺和顏悅色的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說吧，你們和地塊外的那些流匪這幾天偷偷摸摸見面，都談什麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗魯的混混",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老爺子你放過我，我說……我說！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你這軟骨頭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗魯的混混",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "潔西卡，去踹他一腳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，好……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在幹嘛？在我的褲子上擦你的鞋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……算了。潔西卡。你準頭怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還、還不錯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那行，對著他耳朵來一發子彈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱、抱歉，先生，我手……稍微有點抖，剛剛子彈沒打中，你不用喊的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒事，多試幾次總能打中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好、好的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是？是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是他們最近缺人手，想在我們這裡招募，我想著反正地塊上的大傢伙也還不起債，不如自尋出路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你說的出路就是讓人淪為賊寇，靠劫掠他人過活嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "又……又不是我逼他們的，我話還沒說完，他們答應得比誰都快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那你們怕什麼，照實說不就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……你帶著把銃衝進來，誰知道我說的哪句話會不會惹你不開心……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在那些流匪藏在地塊什麼地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蠻橫的混混",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我、我哪裡知道……那群人神出鬼沒的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "行了，潔西卡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "粗魯的混混",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老爺子，你只要能放過我倆，這屋子裡你看上什麼，隨、隨便拿……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想不到這些傢伙屋子裡居然還有些好東西，角落裡甚至還有幾瓶啤酒和香檳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們……就這麼放過他們嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只想知道那些失蹤的人到底去哪裡了。如果離開地塊是他們自己的選擇，那我也只好尊重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可我覺得……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不來點嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還是不了，伍德洛先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……味道醇厚，麥香味道也足，喝著挺帶勁……這麼好的酒，他們從哪裡搞來的……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "銀行員工",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
