    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊，伍德洛，潔西卡可是今天晚餐的主角。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒關係的，我只是看到了達維鎮的事情，覺得不能什麼都不做……至於吃的，沒關係，我吃哪塊都可以，剛剛吃了些餅乾，還沒有很餓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你看她都這麼說了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那也不行。本尼，這一塊歸你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "本尼",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃……謝、謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在笑什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒……沒什麼，只是覺得我最初見到您的樣子和現在差別很大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊……我深有體會，他剛來時得罪了不少礦上的工人，大家都覺得這個脾氣又臭嘴又硬的傢伙就是來找碴的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "後來呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "後來他認識了海倫娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "伍德洛可得好好感謝海倫娜，要不是她熱心腸，還願意和那些不討人喜歡的傢伙多說兩句話……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今天多說兩句，明天多說兩句，說到最後，她就能發現那傢伙身上討人喜歡的部分，然後介紹給其他人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當時還有首歌，應該是哪個愛慕她的小伙子寫的——你還記得嗎，邁爾斯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對對對……是有一首，我想起來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "趕緊起個音，我們一起唱——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們這些傢伙，我看誰敢在我的餐廳裡唱——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "♪我孤身一人漂泊至此，身無分文♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "♪家鄉在身後，千里之遙♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "♪面前的荒野，一望無際♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "♪直到遇到她♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "♪她展開雙臂，將我擁入懷♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "邁爾斯",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "♪從此她的雙臂間，盛滿我的家與夢♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……這首歌……是在唱海倫娜女士嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伍德洛",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不是她還能有誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要讓我說……歌詞中說的“她”不像是某個特定的人，也有可能是某個事物的象徵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還能是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也許，這個盛滿家與夢的“她”……就是達維鎮本身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有道理！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們想想，歌還有後半段，裡面提到“她的軀體”，就是能源塔，“秀髮”是上面升騰的白煙，“滾燙的心”呢，就是動力爐的爐膛了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有你們剛唱的那一段，“雙臂”說的是什麼？不就是那些長長的運輸履帶……擁抱著這裡的所有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有那麼多拓荒者用自己手中的工具一點點敲打出了這片地塊，然後在這裡成家立業。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "隨後，更多的年輕人懷抱著夢想來了，追隨上一輩人的腳步，將青春與熱血拋付。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只有“她”，也只能是“她”，值得被每個人牽掛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……怪不得……怪不得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這下……都說通了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海倫娜",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "何況……我身上可不適合寄託夢想與家庭，我可是很有自知之明的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "工程師沒再回答，他眼瞼微垂，頭小幅度向後仰，老闆娘的話將他帶回了過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "♪直到遇到她♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "♪她展開雙臂，將我擁入懷♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里昂",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "♪從此她的雙臂間，盛滿我的家與夢♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "屋子裡所有人都停下了手裡的動作，不再發出其餘的聲音，只放任工程師的歌聲充盈整間餐廳。\n片刻後，鍋爐工粗啞的聲線加入了歌唱，老闆娘也隨聲輕哼。\n就算是一直專心對付盤中食物的伍德洛，也不由自主地用指尖輕點膝蓋，打著節拍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但潔西卡心裡卻莫名惴惴不安，好像心中有層陰影，始終揮之不去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
